# One line ending in this repository: LF, in the index and in the working tree.
#
# We carried ~20 hand-written files in CRLF for months and asked every session to
# preserve whatever a file already had, because a tool that rewrote them turned a
# one-line edit into a whole-file diff. That is a rule a human has to remember, so
# it belongs here instead: git now normalises on the way in and checks out LF on
# the way back. The project is developed and deployed on Linux only (CLAUDE.md).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries git must never look inside. Everything else is text.
*.png  binary
*.ico  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.jar  binary
